WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
1. Choose the moving child and target parent

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
2. Pick the child’s attachment point

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
3. Pick the parent’s attachment point

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
4. Choose a hinge or a fixed connection

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.042
Motion replay: bring the child and parent anchors together.

00:00:14.042 --> 00:00:16.083
Motion replay: rotate around the connected anchor on the free Z axis.

00:00:16.083 --> 00:00:19.083
5. Create, pose, and save the joint
